Like any magic guild, Inquisitors dislike warriors, so
for those who have advanced in the military field, the way here is closed. The Inquisitors
fully devoted themselves to the teachings of the Weaver, and therefore know only that magic,
the one he used is Fire magic, and they know it perfectly. It is thanks to this
magic, inquisitors have powerful protection against both combat and magic
attacks. And their attacks, enhanced by fire magic, make them treat the Inquisitors
with due respect. The Purification magic available only to them is capable of depriving
The enemy has many magical advantages, the magic of Shackles can bind the enemy's hands, and
Rebirth - get rid of an annoying enemy by sending him into the clutches of monsters.
